<section id="pricing" class="doors section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow doors__kicker">Membership</p><h2 class="section-title doors__title">Charge what the job is worth.</h2><p class="doors__sub">The high-ticket system I used to build a service business, now in three ways to get it.</p><div class="doors__intro"><h3>Three ways in. Start where you are.</h3><p>Some owners want the map and the quiet to work it themselves. Some want me in their corner while they build. Both are good ways to grow, and you can move when it makes sense to you.</p><p>I built a TV mounting business to $512,022.13 in one year. Everything below comes from doing that work, not from theory.</p></div><div class="doors__grid"><article class="door "><p class="door__name eyebrow">Door 1 · The Foyer</p><p class="door__price">$1/month</p><h3 class="door__head">Get in the room for a dollar.</h3><ul class="door__list"><li>Join the HTSA community on Skool for $1 a month.</li><li>Read the tips I post on pricing, Google, and getting paid what the job is worth.</li><li>See how other home service owners are working through the same problems you have.</li><li>Look around before you decide whether you need anything more.</li></ul><a class="btn-primary door__cta" href="https://www.skool.com/high-ticket-home-services-2405/plans">Join the Foyer for $1/month</a></article><article class="door "><p class="door__name eyebrow">Door 2 · The Roadmap Course</p><p class="door__price">$497 one-time. Lifetime access.</p><h3 class="door__head">The full system, without a call with me.</h3><ul class="door__list"><li>The full system I use to win high-ticket jobs, from pricing to Google Ads to SEO, start to finish.</li><li>Go from chasing cheap jobs to running a business wealthier clients book.</li><li>Pay once and keep it for life. No monthly bill.</li><li>Work through it at your own pace, on your own schedule.</li><li>Built for owners who want the plan and are ready to do the work themselves.</li><li>Just so you know: this course doesn&#39;t include access to me. That means no calls, no DMs, and no Q&amp;A.</li></ul><a class="btn-primary door__cta" href="https://www.skool.com/high-ticket-home-services-2405/classroom/42b0c716">Get the Roadmap for $497</a></article><article class="door door--feature"><p class="door__name eyebrow">Door 3 · Launch Pricing (Done With You)</p><p class="door__price">$1,997/month. Month to month. Cancel anytime.</p><h3 class="door__head">I built The Mounting Man to a $512,022.13 year. Now we set your business up to run the same way.</h3><p class="door__subhead">We set up your agents and your whole system the way The Mounting Man runs. That&#39;s how you cut a lot of waste and make more on every job. My numbers are my proof, not a promise of yours. At launch pricing, as one of the first people in the group, you get the most of my time while we build it.</p><p class="door__included">Everything inside is included at $1,997/mo: every course, system, and resource, now and anything added later, for as long as you stay subscribed.</p><p class="door__label">Make more on every job</p><ul class="door__list door__list--tight"><li><strong>Raise your prices.</strong> We set them to what the job is worth, and I show you how I priced The Mounting Man.</li><li><strong>Build the brand.</strong> We give your business Hollywood polish, the kind that makes people who pay more pick you before they ever call.</li><li><strong>Go where the money is.</strong> We aim your marketing at the wealthiest neighborhoods in your area, where people pay for the job done right.</li></ul><p class="door__label">Cut the waste</p><ul class="door__list door__list--tight"><li><strong>Your Google Ads.</strong> My agents go through your ad spend and find the wasted clicks and budget: the searches that cost you money and never booked a job. Then we cut them together.</li></ul><p class="door__label">What you get at launch pricing</p><ul class="door__list"><li>Personal access to me, plus weekly live calls.</li><li>My personal number for your questions.</li><li>Done-with-you help, one thing at a time, with anything else you need: SEO, AEO (showing up in AI answers), Facebook ads, and everything in the High-Ticket Service Academy and in how I built The Mounting Man.</li><li>Help building your own AI agents to take care of your business. Some owners find they can drop software they&#39;ve been paying for once their agents handle that work.</li><li>Month to month, and you can cancel anytime. I recommend giving it three months to see the full benefit, but that&#39;s your call.</li></ul><a class="btn-primary door__cta" href="https://www.skool.com/high-ticket-home-services-2405/plans">Join at launch pricing, $1,997/month</a><p class="door__fine">Launch pricing access reflects where the group is today. How I give access may change as the group grows. Results shown are my own. My numbers are my proof, not a promise of yours, and your results depend on your market and your work.</p></article></div></div></section>
